# libFuzzer dictionary for tz-rs's TZif (RFC 8536) file parser (TimeZone::from_tz_data).
# Grammar: libFuzzer dict tokens accept only \\, \" and \xHH escapes — no other escapes, and every
# token must be on a single line (a literal newline inside a token breaks the whole file).
"TZif"
"\x00"
"\x32"
"\x33"
"UTC\x00"
"\x00\x00\x00\x00"
"\x00\x00\x00\x01"
"\xff\xff\xff\xff"
